    "Analog model library for `pcbpilot sim analog` (pkg/analogsim). Parts are matched by LCSC C-number, exact MPN, then nameRegex (MPN / value / device name), like power-models.json.",
    "Numbers are TYPICAL datasheet values transcribed per part (confidence approx unless a line says otherwise) — check the current datasheet revision before signing off a marginal result. A part with no entry gets the defaults block and every result that depends on it is marked assumed.",
    "Behavioural subcircuits live in pcbpilot-generic.lib (same folder). Vendor SPICE models: drop the .lib/.cir file into vendor/ and add a vendorModels[] entry mapping its .subckt pin order to roles (see README.md).",
    "Units: Hz, V, A, ohm, F, s; slewVPerUs in V/µs; aolDB in dB; headroom = distance from the rail the output (or input common mode) can reach, negative = beyond the rail."
